-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">ANTI_SPAM</code>命中反作弊</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jFvfN9KJ\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">BID_TYPE_EXPIRED</code>选择的出价产品暂不支持成本保障</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cpZL30iD\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">MANUAL_JUDGE_SPAM</code>有异常的作弊行为</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cl3aTcRT\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">AUD_BID_CHANGES</code>单日修改定向/出价超过2次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-diuRaCtk\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">AUD_ROI_CHANGES</code>单日修改定向/ROI目标超过2次</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-GR62ovQ8\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-8kmLeBAo\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-erQKSlnd\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-2\" data-level=\"2\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22JI0O3%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>end_reasons</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-g7e519qf\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-wor